  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 180 °C fan and line a baking tray.",
    "Mix the water and flax and leave 5 minutes to thicken.",
    "Beat the butter, sugar and vanilla until pale, then mix in the flax egg.",
    "Sift in the flour, bicarbonate and cornstarch and mix into a thick dough, then add the chocolate chunks.",
    "Scoop 40 g balls, make a dent in each, fill with Biscoff spread and close the dough over it.",
    "Bake as balls (don't flatten), well spaced, for 10–12 minutes until the edges are lightly golden. Shape with a round cutter while warm and let them cool.",
    "Melt the white chocolate, stir in 1 tbsp Biscoff spread and let it thicken slightly.",
    "Set each cookie on a circle of chocolate, cover it completely, sprinkle with crumbled biscuits and chill until set."
  ]
